      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how deeply hurt and permanent this loneliness feels, and I want to validate that your pain is real and valid right now. Please know that your safety is the absolute top priority, and if you are having thoughts of hurting yourself because you feel like a nobody, there is help available immediately you can call or text 988 in the US or 111 in the UK. It is okay to not be okay, and reaching out to a therapist or crisis line can provide a space where you don't have to face being erased alone.",
